EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-3plyvy_curator-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3itlly_stage-builds-without-install-mutation/README.md-5-
EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-3plyvy_curator-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3itlly_stage-builds-without-install-mutation/README.md-6-## Scope
EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-3plyvy_curator-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3itlly_stage-builds-without-install-mutation/README.md:7:Own immutable plan types and private build-staging orchestration within internal/install, with narrow injected interfaces for toolchain, cache inspection, builder, clock, and filesystem generation reads. Keep live target mutation adapters outside this task and owned by TASK-260720-2284br. Preserve closure provider order and sort build command names lexically within a node. Plan source identity and context, collision, system and MCP requirements, audit, registry attestation, and moved-tag gates before building. Inspect protected cache state and emit per-command hit, would-preflight-and-build, would-rebuild-untrusted-cache, corrupt, or unsupported results. Dry-run may create and remove exactly one manager-owned operation-private ephemeral root containing only closure-workspace and toolchain-probe subtrees, never invokes go list or go build, never writes persistent state, and removes the root on every return. A real run builds every miss in operation-private staging and returns a staged result but does not publish or change live installation targets.
EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-3plyvy_curator-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3itlly_stage-builds-without-install-mutation/README.md-8-
EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-3plyvy_curator-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3itlly_stage-builds-without-install-mutation/README.md-9-## Acceptance Criteria
EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-3plyvy_curator-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3itlly_stage-builds-without-install-mutation/README.md-10-A failing manifest, skill check, closure, collision, system, MCP, audit, registry, moved-tag, toolchain, cache, go-list, or go-build step occurs before any persistent install, consumer, marker, runtime, shim, adapter, journal, or live-cache mutation; build misses execute provider-first and command-lexical and successful staged outputs remain private; failure of build two after build one succeeds deletes staging and preserves prior installation and live cache byte-for-byte; cache hits perform no source-aware Go command; dry-run reports exact logical source, target, key, and outcome, performs no go list or build, creates at most one manager-owned operation-private ephemeral root under the caller temporary directory containing closure-workspace and toolchain-probe state only, removes that root on every return, and leaves every enumerated persistent path and lock absent or unchanged; project and global legacy script-only install tests remain green.
EPIC-260720-21aq1i_declarative-compiled-builds/STORY-260720-3plyvy_curator-go-build-driver/TASK-260720-3pwg2w_protect-immutable-build-cache/README.md-6-## Scope
